    <string name="tour_start">Start</string>
    <string name="tour_finish">Start using Escriba</string>
    <string name="tour_welcome">Record on the watch, transcribe and summarize on the phone, and keep each conversation as a note in your Obsidian vault.</string>
    <string name="tour_welcome_private">Everything happens on this phone: no Internet and no accounts. The audio travels from the watch encrypted.</string>
    <string name="tour_welcome_profiles">Each profile (work, a client, ideas…) decides where the notes go, what summary is made and whether the audio is kept.</string>
    <string name="tour_welcome_minutes">In a few minutes it\'s ready: the vault, the models, the watch and two permissions.</string>
    <string name="tour_vault_lead">Escriba writes the notes in a folder of your vault (e.g. Documents/Obsidian/Escriba) and can only touch what\'s inside.</string>
    <string name="tour_choose_vault">Choose the vault folder</string>
    <string name="tour_choose_models">Choose the models folder</string>
    <string name="tour_need_speakers">Who speaks (optional)</string>
    <string name="tour_need_parakeet">Parakeet (optional, faster)</string>
    <string name="tour_watch_lead">Install Escriba on the watch, open it and tap \"Pair watch\" here. Both will show the same code: check it and confirm.</string>
    <string name="notifications">Notifications</string>
    <string name="notifications_hint">To see what\'s being transcribed or summarized.</string>
    <string name="allow_notifications">Allow notifications</string>
    <string name="no_battery_optimization">No battery optimization</string>
    <string name="battery_hint">If the system closes Escriba, the audio waits on the watch.</string>
    <string name="tour_magicos">On MagicOS, also</string>
    <string name="tour_magicos_hint">Settings → Battery → App launch → Escriba: turn off \"Manage automatically\" and turn on all three options.</string>
    <string name="tour_ready_lead">You can now record from the watch: the app\'s button, the Tile or the complication. The notes will show up in your vault.</string>
    <string name="tour_ready_hint">What\'s pending can be done later in Settings, and this tour can be repeated from Settings → Welcome tour.</string>

